# Anchored to the repo root.  A bare "screenshots/" also matched
# docs/screenshots/, which made that documentation folder impossible to
# track.  Playwright baselines live in tests/e2e/*-snapshots/ and its
# failure output lands in test-results/, both ignored below.
/screenshots/
attachments/
artifacts/
test-results/
playwright-report/
