!.env.example
.DS_Store
# Apple private keys and signing credentials. Per secrets policy, authoritative
# credentials live in Infisical (read with fleet-secrets).
# Exclude key and keystore files so accidental drops in the repo are never staged.
*.p8
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

